# Nyxus Suxyn shell — type manifest.
#
# Quickshell auto-discovers `pragma Singleton` files in the config directory at
# runtime, so the shell ran fine without this. Tooling did not: with no qmldir,
# qmllint cannot resolve Theme or Bus, so every `Theme.textMuted` came back as
# "Member not found" and the real problems were buried in dozens of false ones.
#
# Declaring the types here makes `qmllint shell/*.qml` a usable gate — which is
# one of the reasons Quickshell was chosen over eww in the first place
# (docs/SHELL_FRAMEWORK_EVALUATION_2026-08-02.md §4.3: a headless lint that
# catches the misspelled-property class of defect without a bake).
#
# ADD NEW FILES HERE. ⚠ Once a qmldir exists, Qt turns OFF implicit
# same-directory type registration — a component missing from this list does
# NOT load at runtime ("X is not a type" at the use site), and it is invisible
# to the linter. Proven live 2026-08-03: Swirl.qml loaded fine in a bare test
# directory and failed in the shell until it was declared here.
module nyxus

singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
singleton Bus   1.0 Bus.qml
